---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Subscribed — Field Notes"
  description="You'll get the next note when there is one worth sending."
>
  <section class="wrap" style="padding-top: 96px; padding-bottom: 96px;">
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="mono-label">Subscribed</p>
      <h1
        style="margin: 20px 0 18px; font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 40px); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.028em;"
      >
        That's it. Nothing else to do.
      </h1>
      <p>
        You'll get the next note when there is one worth sending, and nothing else. No welcome
        sequence, no confirmation of your confirmation. Unsubscribe is one click, in every email.
      </p>
      <p>
        In the meantime there are <a href="/">two notes</a> to read, and one of them explains
        <a href="/about">why this is on a domain called buzzwin.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
